@startuml
title <size:24>System Context View: K8sManager</size>\n<size:24>Operator drives K8sManager, which speaks REST natively to the Kubernetes API server, cloud identity providers (AWS STS, Google OAuth and STS, Microsoft Entra ID, generic OIDC), Prometheus, and configured LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenAI-compatible). No external binary (kubectl, helm, aws, gcloud, kubelogin) is invoked except as a fallback for unknown exec plugins.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

